{"content":[{"c":["BELA (P",{"c":["erson"],"sourceClass":"lc","t":"span"},")"],"sourceClass":"h1","t":"p"},{"c":["1. Beor’s son, a king of Edom who ruled before Israel had a king (",{"href":"?bref=Gen.36.31-33","r":"Gen.36.31-33","rawR":"Gen.36.31-33","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Gen.36.31-33","value":"Gen.36.31-33"}],"t":"ref","v":"Gn 36:31-33"},"). Because Balaam, the pagan prophet from north Syria, also had a father named Beor (",{"href":"?bref=Num.22.5","r":"Num.22.5","rawR":"Num.22.5","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Num.22.5","value":"Num.22.5"}],"t":"ref","v":"Nm 22:5"},"), some ancients and a number of modern critical scholars have confused the Edomite Bela with Balaam."],"sourceClass":"list","t":"p"},{"c":["2. Benjamin’s oldest son (",{"href":"?bref=Gen.46.21","r":"Gen.46.21","rawR":"Gen.46.21","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Gen.46.21","value":"Gen.46.21"}],"t":"ref","v":"Gn 46:21"},"; ",{"href":"?bref=1Chr.8.1","r":"1Chr.8.1","rawR":"1Chr.8.1","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"1Chr.8.1","value":"1Chr.8.1"}],"t":"ref","v":"1 Chr 8:1"},"), whose descendants were called Belaites (",{"href":"?bref=Num.26.38","r":"Num.26.38","rawR":"Num.26.38","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Num.26.38","value":"Num.26.38"}],"t":"ref","v":"Nm 26:38"},")."],"sourceClass":"list","t":"p"},{"c":["3. Azaz’s son, a descendant of Reuben who lived in Gilead in Transjordan. So vast were his family’s holdings that they pastured their cattle as far east as the Euphrates River (",{"href":"?bref=1Chr.5.8-9","r":"1Chr.5.8-9","rawR":"1Chr.5.8-9","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"1Chr.5.8-9","value":"1Chr.5.8-9"}],"t":"ref","v":"1 Chr 5:8-9"},"). In the reign of Saul, his family successfully held their land against Hagrite opposition."],"sourceClass":"list","t":"p"}],"format":"bsb-study-dictionary-v2","id":"BelaPerson","provenance":{"archiveSha256":"10758ea00dbea7540f9337e43e59c8e4000295c1261e3426bab6f31c31dcff5b","release":"1.6","sourceCitationReferences":[{"anchorText":"Gn 36:31-33","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Gen.36.31-33","rawQueryValue":"Gen.36.31-33","sourceRefExact":"Gen.36.31-33"},{"anchorText":"Nm 22:5","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Num.22.5","rawQueryValue":"Num.22.5","sourceRefExact":"Num.22.5"},{"anchorText":"Gn 46:21","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Gen.46.21","rawQueryValue":"Gen.46.21","sourceRefExact":"Gen.46.21"},{"anchorText":"1 Chr 8:1","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=1Chr.8.1","rawQueryValue":"1Chr.8.1","sourceRefExact":"1Chr.8.1"},{"anchorText":"Nm 26:38","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Num.26.38","rawQueryValue":"Num.26.38","sourceRefExact":"Num.26.38"},{"anchorText":"1 Chr 5:8-9","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=1Chr.5.8-9","rawQueryValue":"1Chr.5.8-9","sourceRefExact":"1Chr.5.8-9"}],"sourceItemFragmentSha256":"2abcd5ff3c88ef30ecb59c9a0de939a2f59579d0e5373ed6afc19f44960c7cb8","sourceItemName":"BelaPerson","sourceItemOrder":158,"sourceMember":"Articles/B.xml","supplementPointersNotIncludedAsContent":[]},"sourceAttributes":{"name":"BelaPerson","product":"TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","typename":"Article"},"sourceTitleExact":"Bela (Person)","title":"Bela (Person)","version":"v2-a101d843a2f0cd3fc0c6"}